WEBVTT

00:00:16.462 --> 00:00:17.463
(GASPS)

00:00:38.693 --> 00:00:39.735
(GRUNTING)

00:00:40.616 --> 00:00:41.877
Hello, Gru!

00:00:41.964 --> 00:00:45.491
Hey hey! Nice work, Dr. Nefario!

00:00:45.776 --> 00:00:47.457
I put an antidote in the jelly.

00:00:48.469 --> 00:00:52.206
I mean, I'm happy to create an evil army
to destroy the world,

00:00:52.419 --> 00:00:54.800
but nobody messes with my family.

00:00:55.447 --> 00:00:56.769
Thank you, Doctor.

00:00:57.504 --> 00:00:59.213
Now, let's go get the...

00:01:00.678 --> 00:01:01.716
Hi!

00:01:01.921 --> 00:01:03.419
You brought the girls?

00:01:03.843 --> 00:01:06.011
Yes!
Oh.

00:01:06.227 --> 00:01:07.430
Was that wrong?

00:01:11.058 --> 00:01:12.810
(YELLING TRIUMPHANTLY)

00:01:17.738 --> 00:01:19.754
What's happening to my minions?

00:01:20.067 --> 00:01:21.068
Gru?

00:01:23.317 --> 00:01:25.803
You guys, take care of the rest of
the minions.

00:01:26.337 --> 00:01:28.159
I'm going to find Lucy.

00:01:38.550 --> 00:01:41.088
Eat jelly, you purple freaks!

00:01:41.383 --> 00:01:43.007
Whoa! Whoa!

00:02:10.512 --> 00:02:11.894
It's over, El Macho.

00:02:12.317 --> 00:02:13.454
Now, where is Lucy?

00:02:13.637 --> 00:02:14.830
(CHUCKLES)

00:02:15.024 --> 00:02:16.290
Let me show you.

00:02:26.884 --> 00:02:28.135
(GASPS)

00:02:28.803 --> 00:02:30.179
Oh, hey, Gru!

00:02:30.262 --> 00:02:33.911
Turns out you were right
about the whole El Macho thing, huh?

00:02:34.126 --> 00:02:35.226
Yay!

00:02:35.815 --> 00:02:39.313
One push of this button,
and I send that rocket

00:02:39.486 --> 00:02:43.551
straight into the same volcano
where I faked my death.

00:02:44.026 --> 00:02:46.566
Only this time, it's for real.

00:02:47.079 --> 00:02:48.405
No!

00:02:48.469 --> 00:02:50.074
-Yah!
-(GASPS)

00:02:50.199 --> 00:02:51.492
Tallyho!

00:02:58.660 --> 00:03:01.584
We could have ruled
the world together, Gru!

00:03:02.725 --> 00:03:04.004
But now,

00:03:04.505 --> 00:03:06.090
you're gonna die.

00:03:07.091 --> 00:03:08.092
(GASPS)

00:03:10.553 --> 00:03:11.637
(GRUNTING)

00:03:27.152 --> 00:03:28.195
(ROARS)

00:03:30.421 --> 00:03:32.157
-Oh!
-(GUN CLICKING)

00:03:35.119 --> 00:03:36.203
(GROWLS)

00:03:37.454 --> 00:03:38.622
(GRUNTING)

00:03:39.498 --> 00:03:41.250
(GROWLS ANGRILY)

00:03:41.417 --> 00:03:42.835
(LAUGHING EVILLY)

00:03:42.918 --> 00:03:44.420
(YELLS)

00:03:45.671 --> 00:03:46.714
(YELLS)

00:03:46.797 --> 00:03:47.882
(GRUNTS)

00:03:51.260 --> 00:03:52.303
Ah!

00:03:52.928 --> 00:03:54.221
(GRUNTING)

00:04:10.613 --> 00:04:12.364
(GRUNTING AND GROANING)

00:04:14.950 --> 00:04:16.410
(GRUNTS)

00:04:18.059 --> 00:04:20.688
Mmm, lipstick taser!

00:04:21.415 --> 00:04:22.967
Aw, he copied me.

00:04:29.937 --> 00:04:33.668
I am not afraid of your jelly guns.

00:04:34.203 --> 00:04:37.473
Oh, this ain't a jelly gun, sunshine.

00:04:37.556 --> 00:04:39.183
(GUN FARTING)

00:04:39.725 --> 00:04:41.101
(GASPING)

00:04:42.353 --> 00:04:44.396
(MINIONS CHEERING)

00:04:45.981 --> 00:04:47.024
Ho-oh!

00:04:51.692 --> 00:04:53.739
Don't worry about me, Gru, I'll be fine.

00:04:53.972 --> 00:04:56.158
I have survived lots worse than this.

00:04:56.571 --> 00:04:57.743
Okay, that's not entirely true.

00:04:57.748 --> 00:04:59.912
I'm actually kind of freaking out up here!

00:05:00.037 --> 00:05:02.122
Don't worry, I will get you out of this.

00:05:07.670 --> 00:05:08.963
(BOTH GASP)

00:05:10.737 --> 00:05:12.758
I really hate that chicken.

00:05:24.436 --> 00:05:25.896
(GRUNTING)

00:05:33.904 --> 00:05:34.989
(ALL CHEER)

00:05:37.928 --> 00:05:39.743
LUCY: Is there a red one?
It's usually the red one!

00:05:42.454 --> 00:05:44.739
Gru, anytime now!

00:05:45.534 --> 00:05:46.670
(GASPS)

00:05:47.067 --> 00:05:49.586
Listen, Lucy, we may not get out
of this alive,

00:05:49.670 --> 00:05:51.489
so I need to ask you a question.

00:05:51.552 --> 00:05:53.173
Uh, better make it quick.

00:05:53.632 --> 00:05:57.094
If I had asked you out on a date,
what would you have said?

00:05:57.688 --> 00:05:58.762
Are you kidding me?

00:05:58.916 --> 00:05:59.998
Yes!

00:06:01.223 --> 00:06:02.324
(GASPS)

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:03.392
-Jump!
-(SHRIEKS)

00:06:09.523 --> 00:06:10.899
(BOTH YELL)

00:06:13.485 --> 00:06:14.528
(GASPS)

00:06:16.396 --> 00:06:17.531
Lucy!

00:06:18.115 --> 00:06:19.909
Lucy, where are you?

00:06:21.952 --> 00:06:23.037
(GASPS)

00:06:23.324 --> 00:06:24.705
Oh, Lucy!

00:06:25.414 --> 00:06:26.623
Gru!

00:06:27.708 --> 00:06:28.751
(BOTH GASPING)

00:06:30.899 --> 00:06:34.381
Sorry! I guess you need your arms
to tread water, huh?

00:06:36.175 --> 00:06:38.677
(CHANTING IN MINIONESE)

00:06:43.098 --> 00:06:44.641
They'll be back.

00:06:52.983 --> 00:06:55.277
(SINGING I SWEAR IN MINIONESE)

